{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:49 2026-10-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:49 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:49 2026-10-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a9cf22205abd84ed356772ebb996d96a/2026-10/FotoJet_10.jpg\"/><p>銅鑼灣維多利亞公園有野豬出沒。今日（22日）早上7時17分，一隻約一米長的野豬闖進維園範圍內，在公園不斷踱步，又在小山丘附近徘徊。其間牠享受日光浴，狀甚悠然自在。惟公園內晨運客見狀，大驚報警。</p><p>警員接報指野豬由維園步往天后方向，隨即趕往現場，並手持盾牌戒備。人員其後通知漁農自然護理署，派員捕捉野豬。</p><img alt=\"一隻約一米長的野豬闖進維多利亞公園。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e6d6e839a3f42699e5330ab9faa6ebd8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_39.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"野豬在小山丘附近徘徊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2d38c966c44a03fdeb31d3b6ff40fe0f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_38_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"野豬享受日光浴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/35d5e8b5b876aee0cbc5a17839f67c53/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_38_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2cfdb2e208760d8c6d92634da1933c6b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_38.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2039d91cffbbdff36dc151a80611deae/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_37.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員手持盾牌戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/00bdfa006f36c54e1332b372398efd75/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_40_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f802473725e27f0df420d1e739ba6dc0/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_40.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/24b96bee1036c272d5c7f774a7dc2330/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_42.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e9049e2ddd437f8d2cb6a5d8eea6dc34/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_41_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/bea7703aad23631e54723f032e03c9a6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_40_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員手持盾牌戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b5cbe9d0ffee1a3fe56391314c8a914a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_39_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8039c1266bba2ff85778a12fc3049e46/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_24_42_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T02:21:52.077481+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T01:49:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T03:37:57.949776+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T02:17:53.179594+00:00","content_hash":"c5d95af002df6f7d1f3f7a179dac52d45c85e6e8933e02104d3f92d7845e7c2e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}